    rdfs:label "Code Table D-10: Significant Weather Phenomena"@en ;
    dct:description "The items within this code table are the types of weather phenomena of significance to aeronautical operations – as used in SIGMET and AIRMET reports and specified in Technical Regulations, Volume II (WMO-No. 49), Part II, Appendix 6, [C.3.1.] 1.1.4."@en ;
